# A plan view opened, linked and zoomed by the lines after it, with no paint
# between them (docs/desktop.md, "Linked views"): the zoom starts from what
# the view draws - this survey line, far from the origin every new view
# starts at - and the view linked with it follows.
LINE 300000,6200000 300100,6200050
VIEWS OPEN plan
VIEWS LINK 1,2 TO 2
ZOOM IN view=2
